// An inspection robot photographs the fire exit from the end of a hallway (Stringer,
// Figures 7.4 to 7.6, and the example of Section 5.3).  Moves take time: the robot's
// intention is suspended while it is moving and resumes when it arrives.  A move that
// takes longer than its duration is aborted and the inspection fails.

GWENDOLEN

:name: inspector

:Initial Beliefs:

:Capabilities:
{at(room1)} move(room1,room4) {at(room4), ~at(room1)} [duration 5]
{at(room4)} move(room4,room1) {at(room1), ~at(room4)} [duration 5]
{at(room2)} move(room2,room3) {at(room3), ~at(room2)} [duration 5]
{at(room3)} move(room3,room2) {at(room2), ~at(room3)} [duration 5]
{at(room1)} move(room1,hallway) {at(hallway), ~at(room1)} [duration 5]
{at(room2)} move(room2,hallway) {at(hallway), ~at(room2)} [duration 5]
{at(room3)} move(room3,hallway) {at(hallway), ~at(room3)} [duration 5]
{at(room4)} move(room4,hallway) {at(hallway), ~at(room4)} [duration 5]
{at(hallway)} move(hallway,room1) {at(room1), ~at(hallway)} [duration 5]
{at(hallway)} move(hallway,room2) {at(room2), ~at(hallway)} [duration 5]
{at(hallway)} move(hallway,room3) {at(room3), ~at(hallway)} [duration 5]
{at(hallway)} move(hallway,room4) {at(room4), ~at(hallway)} [duration 5]
{at(hallway)} move(hallway,picture_location) {at(picture_location), ~at(hallway)} [duration 5]
{at(picture_location)} move(picture_location,hallway) {at(hallway), ~at(picture_location)} [duration 5]
{at(picture_location)} take_picture {}

:Initial Goals:
route [perform]

:Plans:
+!route [perform] : {B at(room4)} <- move(room4,hallway), move(hallway,picture_location), take_picture,
                                      move(picture_location,hallway), move(hallway,room4), print(inspected);

-!route [perform] : {True} <- print(inspection_failed);
